Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.61,0:22:41.61,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}用盡全力去期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.61,0:22:42.99,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}自由的BAD GIRL
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.99,0:22:44.34,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}故作頑皮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:47.04,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}失常般狂笑 哦啦哦啦哦啦哦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.04,0:22:48.11,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}懶散的BAD GIRL
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.11,0:22:49.15,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}傷感笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:51.15,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}可不許小看我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.46,0:22:52.67,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}放馬過來吧
